category: Libs
build-depends: cygport autoconf-archive gettext-devel
sdesc: "C library to access the HSTS preload list (utilities)"
ldesc: "The HSTS preload list is a list of domains that support HTTPS.
The list is compiled by Google and is utilised by Chrome, Firefox and others."
